msgstr "Editar su perfil"

#: frontend/site-specific/gnu/people/editresume.php:47
msgid ""
"Now you can edit/change the list of your skills and your resume.\n"
"The list of skills can then be matched with the list of jobs in\n"
"our system."
msgstr ""
"Ahora puede editar o cambiar la lista de sus capacidades y su currículum.\n"
"Luego, la lista de capacidades puede compararse con la lista de trabajos de\n"
"nuestro sistema."

#: frontend/site-specific/gnu/people/editresume.php:51
msgid ""
"Note that only members of Savannah groups can post their resumes;\n"
